OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be dry, some  
OL,6,Fearly brightness in the far northwest. 
OL,7,FOtherwise a cloudy day with patchy     
OL,8,Frain spreading northeast this          
OL,9,Fafternoon. Strong south or             
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly wind along exposed       
OL,11,Fcoasts.                                
OL,13,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will clear  
OL,14,Faway northeast this evening. Then the  
OL,15,Frest of the night will see clear with  
OL,16,Fa few showers in the northwest, mainly 
OL,17,Fdry in the east.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
