OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CSunday:FAfter a dry start showery      
OL,6,Frain, occasionally heavy, will spread  
OL,7,Feast in the morning. Brighter with     
OL,8,Fscattered showers in the afternoon.    
OL,9,FBrisk southwesterly winds.             
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMild  
OL,12,Fand windy on Monday with rain, but     
OL,13,Fdrier in the east. Early rain then     
OL,14,Fbright with a few showers on Tuesday.  
OL,15,FSunny spells and showers on Wednesday. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
